</p>
      <div class="testi-attribution">
        <span class="testi-dash">—</span>
        <span class="testi-name">Ana Rodriguez</span>
        <span class="testi-sep">·</span>
        <span class="testi-role">Senior Graphic Designer</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testi-slide">
      <span class="testi-quote-mark">"</span>
      <p class="testi-quote">Andrew values punctuality and organization. He has a reputation for fulfilling his commitments in a timely manner. Andrew will thrive in the most complex of challenges, and he would be a valuable addition to any organization requiring his skillset.</p>
      <div class="testi-attribution">
        <span class="testi-dash">—</span>
