    <div class="testi-slide">
      <span class="testi-quote-mark">"</span>
      <p class="testi-quote">Andrew has a unique combination of creativity and strategic thinking that sets him apart from other designers. He has a deep understanding of user needs and always delivers designs that meet those needs. He was also an excellent communicator, keeping the development team informed about the status of design tasks and providing clear feedback on our work.</p>
      <div class="testi-attribution">
        <span class="testi-dash">—</span>
        <span class="testi-name">Florida Joca</span>
        <span class="testi-sep">·</span>
        <span class="testi-role">Software Developer</span>
      </div>
